@startuml uc-save-plan
!include _theme.iuml

state savePlan as "savePlan()" {

  state " " as RequestingArtifact
  state " " as Recording
  state " " as HandingOver

  [*] --> RequestingArtifact
  note on link
  <b>Change reviewer</b> asks for a plan that can be reviewed
  now and carried out later by someone else
  end note

  RequestingArtifact --> Recording
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> plans as usual and records the identity the
  plan was produced under
  • the authenticated actor
  • each account's numeric identity
  • a digest of every configuration source file
  • a digest of the resolved configuration itself
  end note

  Recording --> HandingOver
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> writes the artifact and gives it an expiry,
  one hour by default
  • it carries no credential
  • it does name private repositories and their
    settings, so it is as sensitive as the configuration
  end note

  HandingOver --> [*]
  note on link
  <b>Change reviewer</b> reviews the file and hands it to
  whoever, or whatever, will apply it
  end note
}

savePlan --> PLAN_SAVED
note on link
the artifact is on disk and reviewable
end note

savePlan -[#A78BFA]-> PLAN_SAVED
note on link
--expires-in narrows the window in which
the artifact stays applicable
end note
@enduml
